# oracle: fix momentum with the angular keyword on a 2d LJ system (sq2 lattice at density 0.8442, 10 x 10 cells, 200 atoms; the 8 x 8 cell density 0.8 setup disagrees between native and engine already at step 0, see the report): the 3d Group::omega sums of src/fix_momentum.cpp at b332f28 (no 2d branch), 20 NVE steps
# native: b332f28 installed lmp (/home/roy/.local/bin/lmp), no extra package
# measured: (filled in by the run)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units          lj
dimension      2
boundary       p p p
atom_style     atomic
lattice        sq2 0.8442
region         box block 0 10 0 10 -0.1 0.1
create_box     1 box
create_atoms   1 box
mass           * 1.0
velocity       all create 1.0 4321 dist gaussian
pair_style     lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff     * * 1.0 1.0 2.5
fix            1 all nve
fix            2 all momentum 1 linear 1 1 0 angular
thermo_style   custom step temp pe ke
thermo_modify  format float %.15g
thermo         5
run            20
